SUMMARY:Pilates in the Park
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, July 18\, for free outdoor mat Pilates led by Revival Pilates. Class begins at 11 am at the Tsuru Family Terrace (the wood deck under the trees) near the lawn. Be sure to bring a mat and water. \nYou must sign up to attend! Book your spot HERE.
